             410                     !  compute virtual potential temp gradient (bf) and winshear square
             411                     !>  - Compute \f$\frac{\partial \theta_v}{\partial z}\f$ (bf) and the wind shear squared (shr2)
                                   <<< Loop-information Start >>>
                                   <<<  [PARALLELIZATION]
