            1077                     !
            1078                     !   compute tke dissipation rate
            1079                     !
            1080                     !>  ## Calculate heating due to TKE dissipation and add to the tendency for temperature
            1081                     !!  Following Han et al. (2015) \cite han_et_al_2015 , turbulence dissipation contributes to the tendency of temperature in the following way. First, turbulence dissipation is calculated by equation 17 of Han et al. (2015) \cite han_et_al_2015 for the PBL
            1082     1                     if(dspheat) then
            1083     1               !
                                   <<< Loop-information Start >>>
