            1124                     !>  ## Solve for the horizontal momentum tendencies and add them to the output tendency terms
            1125                     !!  As with the temperature and moisture tendencies, the horizontal momentum tendencies are calculated by solving tridiagonal matrices after the matrices are prepared in this section.
                                   <<< Loop-information Start >>>
