            1171                     !
            1172                     !     recover tendencies of momentum
            1173                     !
            1174                     !>  Finally, the tendencies are recovered from the tridiagonal solutions.
                                   <<< Loop-information Start >>>
                                   <<<  [OPTIMIZATION]
                                   <<<    PREFETCH(HARD) Expected by compiler :
